{'symbol': 'ZBRA', 'date': '2022-05-26 07:30:00', 'title': 'ZEBRA TECHNOLOGIES COMPLETES COMPREHENSIVE DEBT REFINANCING', 'text': 'LINCOLNSHIRE, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ZEBRA TECHNOLOGIES CORPORATION (NASDAQ: ZBRA), AN INNOVATOR AT THE EDGE OF THE ENTERPRISE WITH SOLUTIONS AND PARTNERS THAT ENABLE BUSINESSES TO GAIN A PERFORMANCE EDGE, TODAY ANNOUNCED ACTIONS TO REFINANCE ITS DEBT AND EXPAND LIQUIDITY. THE COMPANY CLOSED YESTERDAY ON A $3.25 BILLION SENIOR SECURED CREDIT FACILITY MATURING MAY 2027 WITH A LOWER PRICING TIER AT SOFR + 1.00% THAT ESCALATES IF THE TOTAL NET LEVERAGE RATIO IS GREATER THAN 1.5X. THIS FACILITY INC'}